# Coverage HTML reports. *.out was already ignored, so a profile could not be
# committed by accident -- but `go tool cover -html` writes a .html beside it,
# and one of those did turn up untracked in the root. Ignoring the report too,
# because the interesting artifact is the number in the floor file, not a
# rendering of it.
